# Copy to .env and fill in what you need. .env is gitignored — never
# commit real values.
#
# STALE (Phase 2 of PLAN.md): this file previously held non-secret vars
# Docker Compose interpolated into compose.yaml (e.g.
# PERSONAL_MONOREPO_LOCATION), now removed along with the rest of the
# container-era stack. It is kept as a placeholder because the secrets
# interface it used to document is carried forward unchanged into the
# nono-based stack (see PLAN.md's "Secrets" decision row): frontier
# provider keys, EXA_API_KEY, GITHUB_TOKEN, etc. are passed via a
# repeatable `--secret NAME=VALUE` launcher flag, or by exporting a
# `PI_SANDBOX__SECRET__<NAME>` env var on the host before launching. The
# launcher itself never retrieves or decrypts secrets — it only injects
# already-decrypted values. This file will be rewritten with real content
# once the Phase 4 launcher exists.
#
# OAuth credentials: no change in model expected — still not configured
# via this file.
